  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to 10 year Global Strategy for Sustainable Consumption and Production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the development cooperation is to support the implementation of the Global Strategy for SCP, to achieve SDG12 and related SDGs, addressing the triple planetary crisis of climate change, biodiversity loss and pollution, and enhancing human well-being. The cooperation supports the results framework for the 2023-2024 period.</narrative>
  </description>
